```

The workshop checks `package.json`, `android/gradlew`, `android/app/build.gradle`, and `ios/Podfile` for its template. Use the actual approved template layout; a Kotlin DSL Android build file may use a different extension.

The template repository is a generator. Its root is not the generated React Native application.

</TabItem>
