</TabItem>
<TabItem label="React Native delivery">

React Native produces **two native delivery candidates**, not one cross-platform store binary.

| Android candidate | iOS candidate |
| :--- | :--- |
| Verified signed APK/AAB as required by destination. | Verified IPA for its intended distribution method. |
| Package name, version name/code, signer, and hash. | Bundle ID, version/build, signing/profile evidence, and hash. |
| Play/internal destination and exact audience outcome. | App Management/TestFlight/store outcome for its intended audience. |

Record one source/template relationship with separate artifact and route evidence. Shared JavaScript code does not make one platform's signature, security assessment, upload, or tester visibility evidence valid for the other.

</TabItem>
